<section>

<p>033 is the STD (Subscriber Trunk Dialing) area code used for Kolkata, West Bengal, India.</p>

<p>This code is commonly used for landline phone connections in Kolkata region.</p>

</section>

<section>

<h2>Where is 033 Area Code Used?</h2>

<p>033 area code is mainly used in:</p>

<ul>
<li>Kolkata</li>
<li>Nearby West Bengal regions</li>
</ul>

</section>

<section>

<h2>How to Dial 033 Numbers</h2>

<ul>
<li>Within India → Dial 033 + phone number</li>
<li>From outside India → Dial +91 33 + phone number</li>
</ul>

</section>

<section>

<h2>Example</h2>

<p>If a Kolkata landline number is 12345678, dial:</p>

<ul>
<li>033-12345678 (within India)</li>
<li>+91-33-12345678 (international)</li>
</ul>

</section>

<section>

<h2>What is STD Code?</h2>

<p>STD code helps identify telephone regions in India for landline communication.</p>

</section>

