<h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>

<h3>Which city uses 033 area code?</h3>
<p>Kolkata uses 033 STD code.</p>

<h3>Is 033 mobile or landline code?</h3>
<p>It is mainly used for landline numbers.</p>

<h3>How to call Kolkata from outside India?</h3>
<p>Use +91 33 before the landline number.</p>

